OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 500 comments on plans
OL,4,Afor water park
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 500 public comments have been
OL,7,Fsubmitted during an ongoing
OL,8,Fconsultation into plans for a major
OL,9,Findoor water park resort in Derbyshire.
OL,11,FBolsover District Council is gathering
OL,12,Fviews on proposals for a Great Wolf
OL,13,FResorts development at Whitwell Common
OL,14,Fbefore making a decision on the scheme
OL,15,Fat a later date.
OL,17,FThe consultation has been extended
OL,18,Funtil 28 August while further responses
OL,19,Fare collected from residents, councils
OL,20,Fand statutory bodies.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
