OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 500 comments on plans
OL,4,Afor water park
OL,5,
OL,6,FSupporters say the project would bring
OL,7,Fjobs and investment, while opponents
OL,8,Fhave raised concerns about traffic,
OL,9,Fflooding and environmental impacts.
